tgt_text:
Efforts to enhance the role, quality and capability of women in the economic field as referred to in Article 5 paragraph (1) letter d number 4 include:  
a. implementing programs, activities, training for improving women's skills and expertise in order to realize the improvement of women's welfare;  
b. facilitation of business capital strengthening for women with weak economies;  
c. marketing of products from businesses of women with weak economies;  
d. training for developing women's capabilities through economic empowerment of pre-prosperous families;  
e. comprehensive entrepreneurship training for women.

src_text:
Tujuan dibentuknya Peraturan Daerah ini adalah sebagai berikut:  
a. menjadi panduan bagi penyelenggaraan Pemberdayaan Perempuan dan Pelindungan Perempuan oleh Pemerintah Daerah, dunia usaha dan Masyarakat;  
b. menjamin kepastian hukum pelaksanaan penyelenggaraan Pemberdayaan dan Pelindungan Perempuan oleh Pemerintah Daerah, dunia usaha dan Masyarakat;  
c. mewujudkan sinergitas antara Pemerintah Daerah, dunia usaha dan Masyarakat dalam menyelenggarakan layanan penanganan Pemberdayaan dan Pelindungan Perempuan korban tindak kekerasan yang efektif, efisien, transparan dan akuntabel;  
d. memberdayakan Perempuan baik secara individual, keluargay kelompok dan Masyarakat agar mampu hidup mandiri; dan  
e. mencegah, melayani dan menangani Perempuan korban tindak kekerasan dan Perempuan yang mengalami kerentanan untuk mencapai kemandirian.

tgt_text:
The objectives of establishing this Regional Regulation are as follows:  
a. to serve as a guide for the implementation of Women's Empowerment and Women's Protection by the Regional Government, business sector and the Community;  
b. to guarantee legal certainty in the implementation of Women's Empowerment and Protection by the Regional Government, business sector and the Community;  
c. to realize synergy between the Regional Government, business sector and the Community in providing effective, efficient, transparent and accountable services for handling the Empowerment and Protection of Women victims of violence;  
d. to empower Women both individually, in families, groups and the Community so that they are able to live independently; and  
e. to prevent, serve and handle Women victims of violence and Women experiencing vulnerability to achieve independence.

src_text:
1. Pemerintah Daerah mempunyai tugas melaksanakan upaya pencegahan terjadinya kekerasan terhadap perempuan dan anak, meliputi:  
a. mengelola data dan informasi tentang perlindungan perempuan dan anak korban tindak kekerasan;  
b. melakukan sosialisasi peraturan perundang-undangan yang berkaitan dengan penyelenggaraan perlindungan terhadap perempuan dan anak  dari tindak kekerasan;  
c. melakukan pendidikan tentang nilai-nilai anti kekerasan terhadap perempuan dan anak; dan  
d. melakukan pemantauan dan evaluasi terhadap penyelenggaraan perlindungan terhadap perempuan dan anak dari tindak kekerasan.  
2. Pemerintah Daerah dalam melaksanakan tugas sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1), berwenang menyediakan dan menyelenggarakan layanan bagi korban kekerasan, antara lain:  
a. menyediakan dan memfasilitasi terbentuknya pelayanan terpadu untuk korban tindak kekerasan dengan melibatkan lembaga dan unsur  masyarakat;  
b. mendorong kepedulian masyarakat akan pentingnya perlindungan terhadap perempuan dan anak; dan  
c. melakukan pemberdayaan masyarakat untuk pencegahan tindak kekerasan terhadap perempuan dan anak.

tgt_text:
1. The Regional Government has the duty to implement efforts to prevent the occurrence of violence against women and children, including:  
a. managing data and information on the protection of women and children victims of acts of violence;  
b. disseminating laws and regulations related to the implementation of protection for women and children from acts of violence;  
c. conducting education on anti-violence values against women and children; and  
d. conducting monitoring and evaluation of the implementation of protection for women and children from acts of violence.  
2. The Regional Government in carrying out the duties as referred to in paragraph (1), has the authority to provide and organize services for victims of violence, among others:  
a. providing and facilitating the establishment of integrated services for victims of acts of violence by involving institutions and community elements;  
b. encouraging community awareness of the importance of protection for women and children; and  
c. empowering the community for the prevention of acts of violence against women and children.

src_text:
1.  Pemberdayaan dilaksanakan dalam bentuk:  
a . memfasilitasi pengembangan minat dan bakat bagi anak dan  perempuan;  
b. mengembangkan usaha ekonomi bagi perempuan dewasa;  
c. mengembangkan ruang kreatifitas bagi anak dan perempuan; dan  
d. pendampingan bagi anak dan perempuan korban tindak kekerasan.  
2. Pelaksanaan pemberdayaan sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) dapat  bekerjasama dengan lembaga pendidikan, lembaga swasta dan/ atau  lembaga swadaya masyarakat.

tgt_text:
1. Empowerment is implemented in the form of:
a. facilitating the development of interests and talents for children and women;
b. developing economic enterprises for adult women;
c. developing creative spaces for children and women; and
d. assistance for children and women victims of violence.
